these protests?

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.690 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I feel saddened.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel saddened
because, like I said,

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.895 line:92%
