00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.467 line:92%
I was in the riots 30 years ago.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:37.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it makes me sad
because I'm looking at thi

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm knowing that
this is not going to work.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, it's not going to
do anything.

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:44.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have a president
that's standing up there,

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:47.580 align:start size:94% position:6%
