00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.486
I think the only thing he'
going to listen to is votes.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:55.855 size:78% position:39%
And this is why I was
telling everybody,

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
