00:00:58.124 --> 00:01:01.261
you have to fight the same fight
that they're fighting.

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:02.495 line:92%
You have to get into their ring.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have to get educated
and you have to vote.

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:06.866 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It's just the only way.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.936
It's just -- It's almost lik
I wish we would have pulle

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:12.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
a gangster move
and not did nothing

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:16.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
and just waited until November
and just stormed his ass.

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:19.412
You know what I'm saying?
It's just like -- I'm --

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:22.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
It makes me mad
because all these businesses

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
