00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
And trust me.
I hear the protesters.

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:32.392
I'm black.
Of course I hear the protesters.

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:37.764 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I'm just knowing
that they're not being heard

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:40.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, you do have this
perspective, obviously, of age

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:45.772
But you're talking about
Los Angeles in 1992, right

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:46.940 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-'92, yeah.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And so you're
a lot younger then.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:50.043 line:92%
You're obviously very angry.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:52.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what are your memories
of that time?

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:54.047 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-I was 22. I was 22.

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:55.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's why I understand
the protesters

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:59.219
because it's probably nothin
you could say to them right no

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:02.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's going to make them
not want to protest

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:05.358
because there was nothing yo
could have said to me back then.

00:02:05.358 --> 00:02:08.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was ready to burn it dow
because I was like,

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:09.629 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"We got to do something.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:11.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's got to be somethin
that we're doing."

00:02:11.631 --> 00:02:13.133 line:92%
But, you know, at that time,

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
we really thought
we were doing something.

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:17.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
We really thought,
"Hey, we going to tear this up

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:19.472 line:92%
They're going to pay attention."

00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:21.074 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And nothing happened.

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:22.142 size:78% position:39% line:92%
The officers got off.

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:26.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're probably somewhere
fishing, you know what I mean?

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:29.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the city was tore up
for years.

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:32.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
L.A. just really got back to
where it --

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:35.555 align:start size:94% position:6%
The saddest part
is all the businesses,

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:38.191 size:75% position:38%
the black businesses
that got tore down,

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:38.825 size:88% position:44% line:92%
didn't get to come back.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:42.362
Those neighborhoods, you go back
into L.A., are now taken ove

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:45.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
