not black ones.

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:48.434 line:92%
So it's like -- it's like --

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:52.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like we burning dow
our own house.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:53.773 line:92%
-It must be so frustrating

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:56.242 align:start size:94% position:6%
Obviously not only do you have
the perspective of age,

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:59.012 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you have
a much higher profile now.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:03.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you feel as though
you can use this profile

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:03.917 line:92%
to get a message through?

00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:06.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or do you feel like right no
it's just too loud

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:08.955 line:92%
to have any signal be heard?

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:11.824 line:92%
-Man, I don't give a damn.

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:12.926 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I'm going to use it.

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:16.496
I'm going to use my platform
to make sure that everybod

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:19.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
understands
the importance of voting.

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:22.835
You know, we have a lot of
people out there that's like

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:23.970 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"Why do we need to vote?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.837 line:92%
What do we need to vote for?

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:26.005 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why don't all of us
just not vote?"

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:28.508 size:81% position:41%
When you don't vote,
you're voting for him.

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:31.377 line:92%
A non-vote is a vote for Trump

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:34.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
And a lot of people
are making a good argument

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:35.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
"We don't have
nobody to vote for."

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:38.785
Yes, we do.
We have somebody other than him!

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.653 size:84% position:42% line:92%
We need to get him out.

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:41.521 line:92%
And then we need to start

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
realizing what our system
looks like.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.492
I think we all just need t
realize that we're all human

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:49.963
and living on the same Earth and
need to start working together

00:03:49.963 --> 00:03:51.264 line:92%
before we don't have nothing

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:54.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We had our friend Michael Che
on the show yesterday.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:59.939
It was really moving for me to
hear him say that he has never

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:02.575 line:92%
nor would he ever call 911

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:03.943 line:92%
because he did not think tha

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:06.312 align:start size:94% position:6%
that was a service
that was for him

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:08.314 line:92%
or that would make any situation

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:09.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
