better.

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:11.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
What is your --
you know, historically,

00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:13.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
what has your relationship
with police

00:04:13.186 --> 00:04:16.089 line:92%
been like on a one-to-one level?

00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:19.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you know,
like I said again, I'm 52.

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:21.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I've lived through
a lot of stuff.

00:04:21.127 --> 00:04:23.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
My brother was
a hard-core gangster.

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:25.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's been many nights
that I had to go pick him up

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:28.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
