and beat him up.

00:04:34.007 --> 00:04:37.577
You know, so, you know, for me
coming from Compton, you know,

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:39.479 line:92%
the police is a bad thing.

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:41.514 size:81% position:41%
But, you know, like,
you grow up, you know?

00:04:41.514 --> 00:04:44.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
You grow up, and you meet othe
people, you learn things.

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:48.121
And I have learned that there --
all cops ain't bad.

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:49.122 line:92%
I don't think all cops are bad

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:55.161
I think there's a percentage o
