00:05:06.539 --> 00:05:10.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think that they just need to
be retrained.

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:13.913
Damn, Seth, it's really hard t
say what I really want to sa

00:05:13.913 --> 00:05:15.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
because, you know,
you just got to keep

00:05:15.648 --> 00:05:18.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
an even, balanced keel,
