00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:19.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Absolutely.

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:23.756
And I can't imagine how hard
that is, now more than ever.

00:05:23.756 --> 00:05:25.525 line:92%
I do want to talk to you about

00:05:25.525 --> 00:05:27.593 size:78% position:39%
